*.sh text eol=lf
COMMIT export-subst -text
# 内部的计划、验收和进度文档不进 git archive 源码包（/source/ 公开的是程序源码，不含这些内部记录）。
docs/fit/PLAN.md export-ignore
docs/fit/P2-ACCEPTANCE.md export-ignore
docs/fit/P2-ACCEPTANCE-requests.md export-ignore
docs/fit/P2-ACCEPTANCE-results.md export-ignore
docs/fit/HANDOFF.md export-ignore
docs/progress/todo.md export-ignore
docs/progress/pending-test.md export-ignore
# 源码包敏感词表只在内部仓库里，进了源码包就等于把词表本身公开了；deploy/source_gate.py 发版前会再查一遍。
deploy/private export-ignore
deploy/private/** export-ignore
# 加密凭据包按二进制处理，换行转换不能改动它
deploy/private/*.fit-secrets binary
